Service -> Service: 7: Allow retained RECEIVED/STORED/CLAIMED/EXPIRED, not terminal items
Service -> Service: 8: Check legal hold, reservation, verified recipient and competing\ncases
alt Return gates and 1-5 private Staff proofs valid
Service -> Service: 9: Attach unused proof owned by this Staff and item
Service -> Table: 10: Record canonical completed return; set item RETURNED
activate Table
Table --> Service: 11: Returned item
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 12: Online: complete authorized appointment; offline: no synthetic\nclaim
Service -> Service: 13: Append immutable history and custody notifications; commit
Service --> API: 14: Canonical warehouse return
API --> Page: 15: HTTP 200: Canonical warehouse return
Page --> Actor: 16: Show authorized result
else Unverified claimant, other case, hold or invalid proof
Service --> API: 9.1: Do not release property
API --> Page: 9.2: HTTP 409 or 403
